  "details": "In larger worlds, particularly ones that are over 500 MB, there's sometimes a small bit of lag every time someone joins the instance. It usually happens a few seconds before the join notification appears on screen. It's most noticeable in the world Terrors of Nowhere, the lag can sometimes last up to a full second. It's especially bad in a public instance where people are frequently joining. The frequent lag spikes negatively affect the gameplay as well.",
